<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain cuts key rate by 25 bp to 5.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain cuts key rate by 25 bp to 5.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said on Friday it cut its key money rate to 5.25 percent from 5.50 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 3.84 trillion pesetas against 4.49 trillion pesetas bid.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
